Nok Jhok Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Chhapaak based on a true event sang by Siddharth Mahadevan and Shankar Mahadevan.

Strumming Pattern 1: D UUD D UUD,        Strumming Pattern 2: DU chuck DU chuck
Strumming Pattern 3: D UDUD DD UDUD

[Em]Baat baat pe keh dete [C]hain,        [G]Nok jhok Bas nok [C]jhok, bas nok [G]jhok
[Em]Baat baat pe [C]sheh dete hain [G]nok jhok,        Bas [C]nok jhok, bas [G]nok jhok

Hmm.. [G]pal pal chonche maarte rehna,        [G]Chubhti hai par hanste [C]rehna
[G]Taago mein koi girah nahi,        [C]Par baaton mein [D]phanste [G]rehna

[G]Nok jhok, bas nok jhok,        [C]Bas nok jhok, [D]Bas nok jhok
[G]Bas nok jhok, bas nok jhok,        [C]Bas nok jhok, [D]bas nok jhok

[Em]Kitna kuch toh [C]keh lete [D]hain,        [G]Lekin kuch bhi [C]suna nahi [D]hain
[C]Bolti hi rehti hai aank [G]hein,        [D]Kehna hai jo [C]kaha nahi [G]hai..
[G]Kaha nahi hai..[D]

[Em]Seedhe seedhe raaste,        [G]Roothe roothe [Em]lagte [D]hain
[D]Kehna hai jo [C]kaha nahi [G]hai,        Kaha [G]nahi hai…

